    <h2>The honest math</h2>
    <p>If your average job value is $500 and a custom site converts even one extra visitor a week into a call, that is $26,000 of additional pipeline a year. If your average job is $5,000, the math is an order of magnitude bigger. <strong>For a service business with real local-search competition, GoDaddy's builder is the wrong shape: the bundle is convenient, but every dimension that moves leads is below where it needs to be.</strong></p>
